            <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconCopy">F1 M7 7H5.5C4.67157 7 4 7.67157 4 8.5V14.5C4 15.3284 4.67157 16 5.5 16H9.5C10.1529 16 10.707 15.5823 10.9131 15H11.9502C11.7186 16.1411 10.7095 17 9.5 17H5.5C4.11929 17 3 15.8807 3 14.5V8.5C3 7.11929 4.11929 6 5.5 6H7V7ZM14.5 3C15.8807 3 17 4.11929 17 5.5V11.5C17 12.8807 15.8807 14 14.5 14H10.5C9.11929 14 8 12.8807 8 11.5V5.5C8 4.11929 9.11929 3 10.5 3H14.5ZM10.5 4C9.67157 4 9 4.67157 9 5.5V11.5C9 12.3284 9.67157 13 10.5 13H14.5C15.3284 13 16 12.3284 16 11.5V5.5C16 4.67157 15.3284 4 14.5 4H10.5Z</StreamGeometry>
