            <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconPayment">F1 M13.5 13C13.2239 13 13 13.2239 13 13.5C13 13.7761 13.2239 14 13.5 14H15.5C15.7761 14 16 13.7761 16 13.5C16 13.2239 15.7761 13 15.5 13H13.5ZM2 6.75C2 5.23122 3.23122 4 4.75 4H15.25C16.7688 4 18 5.23122 18 6.75V13.25C18 14.7688 16.7688 16 15.25 16H4.75C3.23122 16 2 14.7688 2 13.25V6.75ZM4.75 5C3.7835 5 3 5.7835 3 6.75V8H17V6.75C17 5.7835 16.2165 5 15.25 5H4.75ZM17 9H3V13.25C3 14.2165 3.7835 15 4.75 15H15.25C16.2165 15 17 14.2165 17 13.25V9Z</StreamGeometry>
